      "sourceHash": "adefc1d088e4577f",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们发布了 SupraTTS-0.1-Beta，这是一个仅有约 ~29.6M 参数的小型文本转语音模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "81e005b579ffe8c6",
      "translationZh": "它的音频质量比原版 Glow-TTS（我们的模型采用的就是这个架构！）稍好一些，同时保持了相同的模型大小。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ecb225b10f6eb3b8",
      "translationZh": "这里有一些示例：https://huggingface.co/SupraLabs/SupraTTS-0.1-Beta#samples",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ef369171ce35aa8",
      "translationZh": "模型在 HF 上的链接：https://huggingface.co/SupraLabs/SupraTTS-0.1-Beta",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5028048a3083fef",
      "translationZh": "希望你能用它做些有用的事情，比如在小型边缘设备和 CPU 上使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d91d80a60b67df85",
      "translationZh": "欢迎向我们提供反馈并提问。",
